      en: ["Large urn burials.", "Kotoko cultural heritage.", "Pre-Islamic settlement.", "Significant bronze work finds."],
      es: ["Grandes entierros en urnas.", "Patrimonio cultural de los Kotoko.", "Asentamiento preislámico.", "Hallazgos importantes de obras de bronce."],
